    tied). (Transfer its materials to this card.) If you do, you cannot Normal or
    Special Summon monsters for the rest of this turn. While this Xyz Summoned monster
    is on the field, neither player can activate the effects of monsters with 3000
    or more ATK. Once per turn: You can detach 1 material from this card; return
    1 monster from the field to the hand.'
